OL,3,GNEWSACouncil 'no further forward' with 
OL,4,Aroad closure                           
OL,6,FTwo months after deciding a damaged    
OL,7,Froad into a remote village should be   
OL,8,Fclosed due permanently, the local      
OL,9,Fauthority has not started the court    
OL,10,Fproceedings required to move the plan  
OL,11,Fforward.                               
OL,13,FPart of Saunders Avenue, linking the   
OL,14,FA68 and Hamsterley near Bishop         
OL,15,FAuckland, was shut in January 2023     
OL,16,Fafter the road surface collapsed into  
OL,17,Fthe River Wear.                        
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
